This project is an independent ACP-first Paperclip adapter for Kiro CLI.

Portions of the initial CLI adapter implementation were adapted from
Schapat/paperclip-kiro-adapter (MIT, Copyright 2026 Patrick Scharnow).
The public feat/acp-engine branch was used as a technical reference for Kiro ACP
behavior, limitations, and compatibility tests. This repository has an
independent Git history and is not affiliated with Paperclip Labs or Kiro.
